{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17701","headline":"秋日题陈宗儒圃亭凄然感旧 · 杨巨源","name":"秋日题陈宗儒圃亭凄然感旧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾随何水部，待月东亭宿。\n今日重凭栏，清风空在竹。\n前山依旧碧，闲草经秋绿。\n时物方宛然，蛛丝一何速。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}